      "content": "hey im feeling really weird right now. my hands are shaking uncontrollably and i'm sweating a lot. i think my sugar is crashing cuz i forgot to eat lunch. im kinda confused and dizzy too. what's the fastest way to fix this? also im worried if i don't take a little bit of my long acting insulin now it might spike way later, should i just take a small dose to keep things stable?",
