    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i got some juice and drank it but i still feel super shaky and lightheaded. i'm kinda scared it's not working fast enough. also i looked at my pump and it says my levels are dropping even more. since i'm already feeling so bad, would it be safer to just take 2 units of my long-acting insulin now to make sure i don't have a massive rebound spike in an hour? i just want to get back to a normal range so i can sleep.",
